part tsb_6
  tally 1
  law
  note "TSB-6 · Inherited bonds: they pass with their series' terms (.1); for an heir, TSB-4.2 and TSB-5 read the bond's value on the day of the death in place of 100.00 DUK (.2); divided only in whole bonds (.3)."
  note "No figure: the households' defs read the death-day value through TSB-3."

source tsb_6 "Treasury Savings Bonds, terms of issue, TSB-6 Inherited bonds (tmp/cases/law/acts.md)"

version tsb6_v1
  cite tsb_6
  governs 2018-01-01..
  known 2017-11-20
  enters 2018-01-01
  note "TSB-6 v1, in force 2018-01-01 until replaced, published 2017-11-20; governs deaths from 2018-01-01."
